# bundle snapshot (Adafruit/Community), never shipped in the public repo.
# `requirements.txt` records exact `circup freeze -r` versions; reproducing
# a particular bundle snapshot itself is a known unfilled gap (see README.md
# § Deploy).
lib/asyncio/
lib/adafruit_ticks.mpy
